sity awards, named scholarships and funding attached to specific research projects.</p>\n<p><strong>Official details:</strong> <a href=\"https://study.uq.edu.au/study-options/phd-mphil-professional-doctorate/projects/revolutionise-australian-strata-management-large-language-models\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Read the programme or project information</a></p>\n<p><strong>Application route:</strong> <a href=\"https://study.uq.edu.au/study-options/phd-mphil-professional-doctorate/projects/revolutionise-australian-strata-management-large-language-models\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Follow the official application instructions</a></p>\n<h2>How to Apply</h2><p>Submit your application through the official portal before the deadline: 31 December 2026 (EOI). Read the eligibility requirements carefully and prepare all requested documents — early applications are strongly recommended for competitive awards.</p><p><a href=\"https://study.uq.edu.au/study-options/phd-mphil-professional-doctorate/projects/revolutionise-australian-strata-management-large-language-models\">Open the official application page ↗</a></p><h2>Application guides</h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-read-phd-job-advertisement-before-applying\">How to Read a PhD Job Advert: Funding, Eligibility and Application Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-write-academic-cv-phd-applications-sample\">Academic CV for PhD Applications: Structure and an Example</a></li></ul>",
